main = draw z = Normal in 0.0 * z
-- The sibling of drawBoundZeroTimesNormal with the *random* factor bound
-- instead of the zero: like `0.0 * Normal`, the point mass at 0. It answered
-- (0.0, dim 0), the mass lost, until the zero rule read the operands' laws
-- (law-carrying-modality M6, task dispatch-on-law-certificates): the body's
-- law is a Dirac at 0, so nothing reads z's value and no engine is needed.
-- Found by the rewrite-invariance net's draw introduction (task
-- draw-bound-random-factor-times-literal-zero-loses-dirac-mass).
